{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03070","headline":"郡江南上别孙侍御 · 张九龄","name":"郡江南上别孙侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云嶂天涯尽，川途海县穷。\n何言此地僻，忽与故人同。\n身负邦君弩，情纡御史骢。\n王程不我驻，离思逐秋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}